# Capacitor sync target - the entire compiled Next.js server bundle
# lands here on `npx cap sync`. Bundle inlines env values from
# .env.local at build time, so it MUST never be committed. Belt-
# and-suspenders even though the directory is build output.
android/app/src/main/assets/public/
ios/App/App/public/
ios/build/
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/Podfile.lock
ios/DerivedData/
ios/.symlinks/

